==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|es}} {{term|praestāre|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|praestō|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb|prest|ar}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=es}} to [[give]], [[pay]] {{gloss|e.g., attention}}
#: {{usex|¡'''Prestad''' atención, por favor!|translation=Pay attention, please!|lang=es}}
